# Per-app config lives in apps/<app>/.env.local (see each app's .env.local.example).
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL   Laravel API base URL, exposed to the browser
#   API_INTERNAL_URL      Laravel API base URL for server-side/BFF calls
#   SESSION_COOKIE_NAME   name of the httpOnly session cookie (default: session)
#   ROOT_DOMAIN           apex domain used by dashboard middleware for subdomains
#
# @repo/types codegen (run `npm run gen:types`):
#   the OpenAPI URL is hard-coded in packages/types/package.json for now
#   (http://api.flowerpot.test/docs/api.json) — the backend doesn't expose it yet.
